@startuml
title Multimodal Toolkit - Implemented System Architecture

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

package "Input Modalities" {
  component "GestureDetector\n(MediaPipe/OpenCV pipeline)" as GestureDetector
  component "VoskVoiceAdapter\n(SpeechRecognition + Vosk)" as VoiceAdapter
  component "intent_from_transcript\n(rule-based intent parser)" as IntentParser
}

package "Shared Contracts" {
  component "GestureEvent /\nVoiceEvent" as Events
  component "ActionPayload" as Actions
}

package "Collaboration Core" {
  component "CollaborationRuntime" as Runtime
  component "EventBus" as EventBus
  component "FusionEngine\n(rule-based)" as Fusion
  component "InteractionContextStore" as Context
  component "ApplicationRouter" as Router
}

package "Applications" {
  component "DemoCanvasApp" as DemoApp
  component "ShapePuzzleApp" as ShapePuzzle
  component "LoggingDemoApp" as LoggingApp
  component "Virtual Workspace\n(planned)" as VirtualWorkspace
}

User --> GestureDetector : hand gestures\nvia webcam
User --> VoiceAdapter : spoken commands\nvia microphone

VoiceAdapter --> IntentParser : transcript
IntentParser --> VoiceAdapter : intent label

GestureDetector --> Events : emit GestureEvent
VoiceAdapter --> Events : emit VoiceEvent

GestureDetector --> Runtime : handle_gesture(event)
VoiceAdapter --> Runtime : handle_voice(event)

Runtime --> EventBus : publish_event(event)
Runtime --> Fusion : handle_*_event(event)
Fusion --> Context : remember recent\nmodality state
Fusion --> Actions : emit ActionPayload
Runtime --> EventBus : publish_action(action)
Runtime --> Router : route(action)

Router --> DemoApp : handle_action(action)
Router --> ShapePuzzle : handle_action(action)
Router --> LoggingApp : handle_action(action)
Router ..> VirtualWorkspace : intended app boundary

EventBus --> DemoApp : subscribe_events/actions\n(logging + UI feedback)
EventBus --> ShapePuzzle : subscribe_events\n(custom raw event logic)

note right of ShapePuzzle
Current implementation is hybrid:
- registered as a routed app
- also listens to raw BaseEvent objects
- monkey-patches voice grammar for game commands
end note

note bottom of VirtualWorkspace
Documented in the repo, but no concrete app module
is wired into the runtime yet.
end note

@enduml
